    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114407" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορδο-ποιός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>maker of strings</i> for musical
			instruments, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.154
			</span></i>, who also has <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορδο-ποιία</span></b> , ἡ, <i>the art</i>
			or <i>trade of such a person,</i>
			Adj.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορδο-ποιικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
				<i>fit for such work,</i> and Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span> ibid.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
